        "answer": "From memory, the image I associate with “大笑奶龙” is a chubby yellow cartoon dragon laughing so hard that it leans back. Its head and torso read as one large, rounded egg shape, with a pale cream belly, very short arms and legs, and small horn-like bumps on top. The arms are lifted or flung slightly outward; the little feet sit forward beneath the belly.\n\nThe eyes are squeezed into happy arcs, and the mouth is a huge open oval, dark inside, with a pink tongue and a hint of small white teeth. The overall expression is gleeful and exaggerated. I picture it as smooth, softly shaded 3D animation: glossy, toy-like yellow skin, rounded edges, and gentle shadows.\n\nI remember the background as plain and light, like a white or transparent sticker cutout, with the character filling most of the frame. I’m least certain about the exact arm position, the small details on its head or back, and whether that particular version has a plain background; those can vary between crops and meme edits.",
